122	    /**
123	     * Return the owner's address. When a structured address is supplied (a non-blank
124	     * {@code addressLine1}) it takes precedence and the value is composed as the
125	     * normalized {@code addressLine1}, with a single space and the normalized
126	     * {@code addressLine2} appended when an {@code addressLine2} is present.
127	     * Otherwise the flat {@code address} is returned, preserving backward
128	     * compatibility for owners supplied in the flat form.
