141	     * Set the owner's flat address, normalizing it to a canonical form so it is both
142	     * stored and returned consistently. Leading/trailing whitespace is trimmed,
143	     * internal runs of whitespace are collapsed to a single space, the value is
144	     * upper-cased, and common street-type abbreviations are expanded ({@code ST ->
145	     * STREET}, {@code RD -> ROAD}, {@code AVE -> AVENUE}). A {@code null} value is
146	     * left as-is.
