364	     * Return the owner's membership number, formatted {@code '<customerCode>-M<YY>'}
365	     * where {@code YY} is the last two digits of the registration date's year (for
366	     * example {@code 'SMI-0007-M26'}). Returns {@code null} when either the customer
367	     * code or the registration date is not set.
